note Click a tour in the Tours list to read it. The reader needs it to read a tour at all; without it the tour shown could only change through the CLI. The document switches to that tour, its first step in tree order is selected and scrolled to, and the Tour view is brought to front wherever it is. Clicking the tour already being read keeps its current step and only switches the tab back to Tour.

