note The trigger: each row of the Tours list is a TOUR_ROW numbered by the tour's slot. A click queues OpenTour with the Tour tab, which apply hands to open_tour once the frame is built. The row shows the name, then kind, author and step count dimmed; the name is red and 'n stale' follows when a step is stale, and marked + or ~ when the map diff has the tour as added or changed.
